I would recommend that high performance applications requiring robust I/O
be placed on the AS2100 PCI bus.  The EISA bus on this system does not
provide stellar performance.

The absolute max data transfer rate for the 2100 EISA bus is around 18
MB/s.  However it is unlikely you will get that.  However, we have run a
2100 DU system with Ultra Wide adapters to 37MB/s transfer rates.

Regards,

Rene

