:short  message ,longer message never go out.   Why???

   This likely isn't a `hardware vendor' problem, it's likely a local
   software package (the browser and/or e-mail package) or a local
   configuration problem, or something involving the communications
   link and/or the local the Internet Service Provider (ISP).

   Digital built the hardware and may have created a few of the needed
   device drivers, but the vast majority of the software involved is
   from Microsoft and/or various third-parties.

   If you want to pursue this, you'll want to check around the more
   PC-oriented newsgroups, and with the folks supporting the package(s)
   you are using to browse the newsgroup(s).

