>I've come across a couple of DECStation 3100 system units w/monitor for 
>extremely cheap.  However, I know nothing about these machines.  Can anyone 
>tell me a little more about them, such as CPU type/speed/bus, capabilities, 
>etc?  What are the comparable to?
>
>I'd like to know a little more about them before I plunk and change down on 
>them.
