>> The 6600 in fact only had at most *2* PPUs... To match the speed of
>> the CPU ( 100ns ) and the PPU ( 1us ) they had up to 10 memory banks,
>> and registers. One PPU ran around executing 10 instructions per us,
>> one the visble PPU.
