: eventually catch up with UNIX, because Microsoft's marketing people will keep
: that focus, and the corporation has the time, resources, and motivation to do
: it.

What, you didn't hear?

WNT _is_ Unix.

Bill sez so.

: >You ignore this and go M$ for your critical stuff at your own risk......

: Today, true.  Tomorrow, maybe.  Some day later, UNIX will be the niche player
: that VMS already is.  Be prepared.

We'll see, I guess.  Until NT runs on anything except x86en and Alphas,
I doubt it.   And that 2 processor limit...

