	     (1.25M steps/node)		696.0	  4.91
             DEC 3000/500              3414.5     1.00
             Dell 180MHz PPro          3226.8     1.06
	     (256 kb cache)
sp2 node     IBM RS-6000/590           3220.8     1.06
             DEC 3000/600              2804.7     1.22
             DEC 3000/700              2102.1     1.62 
             Alpha PC 433MHz            861.0     3.97
	     (1mb cache) 
==========================================================

