The Starions come with 1MB video memory standard, you can add another 1MB
as an option.  But even that may not be enough to handle 24-bit color at any
decent resolution.  If you want to run in 24-bit mode, you may do well to
buy a graphics card with 4MB video memory available - the Matrox Millenium is
a good choice.  Just plug it in - the onboard video will disable itself.
