I have to admit, your Intel numbers are quite good.  In fact, they're
substantially above the LINPACK numbers for each of those machines
(not necessarily a good benchmark, but they do serve as a frame of 
reference).  Your Alpha number is about half the LINPACK benchmark.

I'd really be interested to know what the heck is going on.

> > >
> > > Now we should compare prices.... you can get a 200MHz
> > > ppro for under $2000. A dual ppro for under $4000.
