Ah yes, BRL got the last 7600 ever built.  Beautiful looking machine.
They certainly had an eye for physical design (which I think followed
Seymour to his own company, because subsequent CDC gear looked just
as bland as VAX's).  The 7600 was incredible for the time (I think
