Now you're make me feel really old.  My memory may be slipping, but CDC 6xxx 
very much pre-dated CDC Cyber 6x series, although they looked pretty much the 
same from functional point of view.   I worked briefly with Cyber 64 in 
1972-4.  If I recall correctly NOS was several years after that.  I can't 
remember what they called the earlier system, although they were quite 
similar.
>
>The guys from CDC were really impressed with all of the customizing that
