This is probably not the best forum for answering PC related questions.
This forum deals more with issues concerning the Digital VAX/Alpha
sysems and software.

The best place for support is Digital's Support Phone line. The Starion
comes with a one year phone support warranty and 2nd and 3rd year
warranty for hardware (mail-in or carry-in).

Also this forum is not an offical Digital forum, although some Digital
employees will occasional answer questions.

To help, on the 920 you have a system restore CD that contains all of
the software that was loaded on the system in the factory. As a last
resort you could choose to re-install the factory software, but that
would erase whatever is currently on the hard disk. It would probably be
better to call service and explain in detail what your problem is, when
did it happen, what was going on just prior to the problem happening,
what if any new software or hardware has been installed, etc. Sometimes
you can fix a problem by going back to a point where things were working
correctly and determine what took place after that point.

regards,

