:proper connector to tranlate from DB15 to 3 BNC connectors.  If there is
:no way to do it what kind of a card can I get for my PC.  Thanks

   You will need a video card capable of generating 1280 x 1024 x 66 Hz,
   with -- and this is likely the hardest part -- both the horizontal and
   vertical synchronization signals on the green BNC.  The `synch-on-green'
