Troy Bixby wrote:
> 
> My Dec Alpha Server won't boot. "The error is "/usr: write failed, file
> system is full"  and then it just stops.

1. Boot in single user mode (consult your manual to find the magic switch you
need in console mode to do that).
2. run fsck on all file systems (file system check).
3. manually mount /usr.
4. remove some unneeded file from /usr (files in /usr/tmp might be a good start)
5. reboot


